# Step 8 - cache-service (AFTER - cache ON)
# Fire the SAME reads as step 3. With the cache enabled and warm, these are
# served from L1/L2 and should NOT hit SQL. Send the same number of requests
# you sent in step 3 for a fair comparison.

@cache = http://localhost:8086
@region = Europe

### read 1
GET {{cache}}/api/cache/articles/{{region}}
Accept: application/json

### read 2
GET {{cache}}/api/cache/articles/{{region}}
Accept: application/json

### read 3
GET {{cache}}/api/cache/articles/{{region}}
Accept: application/json

